      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795800000000,
      "created": 1795800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same Metro, same three steps. Development keeps the bundle on your computer so a save\nshows up in a second. Release builds it once and ships it inside the app.",
      "originalText": "Same Metro, same three steps. Development keeps the bundle on your computer so a save\nshows up in a second. Release builds it once and ships it inside the app.",
